Hi {Owner},

I build websites for pool service companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews, but no site comes up where an owner can see your weekly plan and book a start date.

So I built a sample first: weekly plans with online booking and autopay, a green pool rescue page, and your route neighbourhoods, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Ten minutes on the phone this week?

